msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:12
#: ac2cfa75ed31479681255511a409e078
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:14
#: fae9cf6c0ab24f269f4a54185dfc3c5d
msgid "By default the auxiliary switches are disabled but you can assign features using the *Mission Planner*'s **Config/Tuning \\| Extended Tuning** screen or by setting the CH7_OPT,  CH8_OPT, CH9_OPT, CH10_OPT , CH11_OPT, or CH12_OPT parameters directly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:22
#: 7ceef6019cd84b238fda01e52467ff6b
msgid "Here are the options:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:43
#: 86a3a746b2b543209ced5af85791aa7f
msgid "The copter moves left, right, forward and back as if it were facing in the same direction as when it took off regardless of the copter's heading. :ref:`See here for more details <simpleandsuper-simple-modes>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:55
#: f467d9f11f8c478e975bb0bc5194cb6f
msgid "Invokes the :ref:`Return-to-Launch <rtl-mode>` flight mode when switch is pulled high. Bringing switch back to low will return the vehicle to the mode indicated by the ch5 flight mode switch."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:66
#: 6282a0db2ba34bf49054bef8e3025795
msgid "Adjust the vehicle level position using the current roll and pitch stick inputs. See details `here <autotrim>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:82
#: 41ec30196f53427fa89326ace01dc1cc
msgid "Camera shutter will be activated. See more details :ref:`here <common-camera-shutter-with-servo>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:93
#: c287ec170be94e4f96cb1eddc08bbdb9
msgid ":ref:`RangeFinder <common-rangefinder-landingpage>` is disabled when switch is in low position, enabled when in high position."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:107
#: db68aee02d674d8287bdfd3ddbef1207
msgid "Similar to simple mode except controls are relative to the home position. Move the pitch stick forward and the copter will fly away from home, pull pitch back and it will return. Move roll stick left or right and the copter to orbit home regardless of the copter's actual heading. :ref:`See here for more details <simpleandsuper-simple-modes>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:113
#: 777090a68d044fe78207db5f13836878
msgid "If mapped to a three-position switch then the function will allow Super-Simple **and Simple** modes to be enabled using the high and middle switch positions, respectively (a two-position switch will enable/disable Super Simple mode only)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:126
#: 1a6a6f5eb55f4d858231868fe996a832
msgid "Turn on automatic leveling in the :ref:`ACRO <acro-mode>` flight mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:136
#: 5d336913ea954507b772488a5be2431b
msgid "Turn on the :ref:`crop sprayer <sprayer>` when switch is pulled high."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:146
#: 4136231dafb64263ad682bea9b520c06
msgid "Invokes the :ref:`Auto <auto-mode>` flight mode when switch is pulled high. Bringing switch back to low will return the vehicle to the mode indicated by the ch5 flight mode switch."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:157
#: c3eadb0ab91c41bbb9d5b7da03b05089
msgid "Invokes the :ref:`AutoTune <autotune>` flight mode when switch is pulled high. Bringing switch back to low will return the vehicle to the mode indicated by the ch5 flight mode switch."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:168
#: 57340efd545347ba8c5d40edacbfd29d
msgid "Invokes the :ref:`Land <land-mode>` flight mode when switch is pulled high. Bringing switch back to low will return the vehicle to the mode indicated by the ch5 flight mode switch."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:179
#: 02708cf17e9340d9803cce9120d71114
msgid "Operates the :ref:`gripper <common-gripper-landingpage>`.  Switch pulled low releases the gripper, high closes or grabs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:189
#: 9df120f778ab4a419e7ddcd76757ef29
msgid "Enables the automatic release of the :ref:`parachute <common-parachute>` (this does not immediately trigger the release)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:199
#: 8a46b94cc47a4145b442ad00c6357208
msgid "Immediately triggers the release of the :ref:`parachute <common-parachute>` as long as the vehicle is not landed or too low."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:209
#: 0f54aa1ee6594edebef67a5140b692bf
msgid "Switch pulled low disables the :ref:`parachute <common-parachute>`.  Switch in middle enables the parachute for automatic release.  Switch pulled high triggers release of the parachute as long as vehicle is not landed or too low."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:219
#: 6903f32fdc5b484cbfb398b84d630ff8
msgid "Reset :ref:`Auto <auto-mode>` to run the first mission command in the command list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:239
#: 803035501b264c8ba6c79b353f0ec1a5
msgid "Move the :ref:`camera mount <common-cameras-and-gimbals>` to its retracted position."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:249
#: 70b6b4516125455aa489eeb1901862bf
msgid "Switch pulled low turns off the first :ref:`relay <common-relay>`, pulled high turns on the first relay."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:259
#: 153939cc0f744bfc85582f55fce615f1
msgid "Switch pulled low turns off the second :ref:`relay <common-relay>`, pulled high turns on the second relay."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:269
#: dcc3a7cfacd64c65ae08cbc33403b425
msgid "Switch pulled low turns off the third :ref:`relay <common-relay>`, pulled high turns on the third relay."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:279
#: 227a56370cda4585b6fdf72553941a5e
msgid "Switch pulled low turns off the fourth :ref:`relay <common-relay>`, pulled high turns on the fourth relay."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:288
#: c6487dbf13bd4f8088cf510728b81b51
msgid ":ref:`Landing Gear <landing-gear>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:300
#: 9800aeb4f87846a9b50a1c6663a61502
msgid "Plays the `lost copter alarm <https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/pixhawk_sound_files/LostCopter.wav>`__ though the buzzer"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:311
#: 25be23d7c6bc4f90b16b389d96df253f
msgid "Stops motors immediately (`video <https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-Db4u8LJE5w>`__)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:322
#: 09105f8376c14606aa6776b0fc294250
msgid "Opposite of Emergency stop (above) in that switch must be ON for motors to spin (`video <https://youtu.be/-Db4u8LJE5w&t=51s>`__)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:333
#: 9db53358d35f40a6b9d7719a7eb61101
msgid "Invokes the :ref:`Brake flight mode <brake-mode>` when switch goes high. Bringing switch back to low will return the vehicle to the mode indicated by the ch5 flight mode switch."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:345
#: 267817648ff04feca347186733e9ccdf
msgid "Invokes the :ref:`Throw flight mode <throw-mode>` when switch goes high. Bringing switch back to low will return the vehicle to the mode indicated by the ch5 flight mode switch."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:357
#: 1a13534684b940088f2ce1a45add0a81
msgid "When switch is high, :ref:`ADSB avoidance <common-ads-b-receiver>` (avoidance of manned aircraft) is enabled, when switch is low, disabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:367
#: f1a28b437892495aa829ee94b06fa16a
msgid "Turns on/off :ref:`Precision Loiter <precision-landing-and-loiter>`.  I.e. holding position above a target in Loiter mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:377
#: 5230d6e557994ac698912c23589cf68a
msgid "When switch is high, avoid objects using :ref:`Lightware SF40c <common-lightware-sf40c-objectavoidance>` or :ref:`TeraRanger Tower<common-teraranger-tower-objectavoidance>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:387
#: beca437b79c74ac78442c8c72fa4e8b0
msgid "Arms the vehicle if the switch goes high (subject to arming checks). Disarms the vehicle if brought low."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:398
#: 0a09c288515f4344840ca27151142c7d
msgid "Check Ch7 & Ch8 PWM values reach 1800"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:400
#: bbfe7fe3db4e4d5d82fecea86e016130
msgid "Your channel 7 and/or channel 8 pwm value must reach at least 1800 PWM or the auxiliary function will not be activated. You can check that it surpasses this threshold using the Mission Planner's radio config page."
msgstr ""
